{"id":"nvme-disconnect-all.1","n":"nvme-disconnect-all","s":"1","src":{"r":{"pkg":"nvme-cli","ver":"2.11-7.el9_6","repo":"BaseOS","url":"https://dl.rockylinux.org/vault/rocky/9.6/BaseOS/x86_64/os/Packages/n/nvme-cli-2.11-7.el9_6.x86_64.rpm","path":"/usr/share/man/man1/nvme-disconnect-all.1.gz","sha256":"71fe6ccbf043abacd93f174504a22ab0ddc790e77ce9a36c82f3f84a3f5aa6df","date":"10/14/2025","origin":"NVMe"},"u":{"pkg":"nvme-cli","ver":"1.16-3ubuntu0.3","repo":"jammy-updates/main","url":"http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/pool/main/n/nvme-cli/nvme-cli_1.16-3ubuntu0.3_amd64.deb","path":"/usr/share/man/man1/nvme-disconnect-all.1.gz","sha256":"dcf48dfd7b6ac0ec2718aa28ab18401c31be99cf7c144791f8fccb89f72860a2","date":"11/11/2021","origin":"NVMe"}},"nopt":{"r":2,"u":0},"desc":"Disconnect from all connected Fabrics controllers.","same":false,"r":[["NAME","<p>nvme-disconnect-all - Disconnect from all connected Fabrics controllers.</p>"],["SYNOPSIS","<pre><i>nvme disconnect-all</i> [--output-format=&lt;fmt&gt; | -o &lt;fmt&gt;] [--verbose | -v]</pre>"],["DESCRIPTION","<p>Disconnects and removes all existing NVMe over Fabrics controllers.</p> <p>See the documentation for the nvme-disconnect(1) command for further background.</p>"],["OPTIONS","<dl><dt data-o=\"\">-o &lt;fmt&gt;, --output-format=&lt;fmt&gt;</dt><dd>Set the reporting format to <i>normal</i>, <i>json</i> or <i>binary</i>. Only one output format can be used at a time.</dd></dl> <dl><dt data-o=\"\">-v, --verbose</dt><dd>Increase the information detail in the output.</dd></dl>"],["EXAMPLES","<div class=\"in\">•Disconnect all existing nvme controllers:  <div class=\"in\"> <pre># nvme disconnect-all</pre> </div> </div>"],["SEE ALSO","<p>nvme-disconnect(1)</p>"],["NVME","<p>Part of the nvme-user suite</p>"]],"u":[["NAME",0],["SYNOPSIS","<pre><i>nvme disconnect-all</i></pre>"],["DESCRIPTION",2],["EXAMPLES",4],["SEE ALSO",5],["NVME",6]],"diff":{"r":["--output-format","--verbose","-o","-v"],"u":[]}}